## All Training Flags

| Flag | Default | Description |
|------|---------|-------------|
| `--data` | **required** | Path to WAV dataset dir |
| `--save` | `checkpoints_clara` | Checkpoint dir |
| `--resume` | None | Resume from `.pt` checkpoint |
| `--resume-optimizer` | off | Also restore optimizer state |
| `--steps` | 50000 | Total training steps |
| `--batch` | 4 | Batch size |
| `--grad-accum` | 4 | Gradient accumulation (eff batch = batch × grad_accum) |
| `--lr` | 3e-4 | Max learning rate (cosine warmup 2000 steps) |
| `--warmup` | 2000 | LR warmup steps |
| `--weight-decay` | 0.01 | Weight decay |
| `--clip-grad-norm` | 1.0 | Gradient clipping norm |
| `--device` | auto | `auto`, `cuda`, or `cpu` |
| `--clip-seconds` | 0.5 | Clip duration. 0.5=fast, 2.0=better quality |
| `--num-workers` | 0 | DataLoader workers (0=safe for ROCm/APU, 8=MI300X) |
| `--cache` | off | RAM pre-cache dataset (~20 GB for MUSDB18-HQ) |
| `--sample-rate` | 44100 | Audio sample rate |
| `--log-every` | 25 | Log every N steps |
| `--ckpt-every` | 500 | Save checkpoint every N steps |
| `--val-every` | 500 | Validate every N steps |
| `--early-stop-patience` | 10 | Early stopping patience |
| `--d-model` | 64 | Model embedding dimension |
| `--d-state` | 16 | SSM state per channel |
| `--n-layers` | 4 | Stacked SSM layers |
| `--conv-width` | 4 | Causal conv kernel (latency = 4 samples) |
| `--dt-rank` | 16 | Discretization rank |
| `--cond-dim` | 8 | Conditioning dimension |

